+## Notes
+
+- [P] tasks = different files, no dependencies on unfinished tasks
+- [Story] labels map tasks to spec.md user stories for traceability
+- The transcript's `<YYYY-MM-DD>` is chosen at verification-run time (branch b: record-authoring date); until then all references use the placeholder
+- The version NUMBER is observed and recorded, never asserted (research R5); the contract is the shape `graphhelm <version>` (C2)
+- Old transcripts are never rewritten (contract D3); a later pass record supersedes by link, not by editing
+- Commit after each task or logical group; stop at any checkpoint to validate the story independently
+- Avoid: vague tasks, same-file conflicts between parallel tasks, cross-story dependencies that break the one-landing-unit property
